abstract: >-
  Olla-DFT prepares, runs and post-processes Quantum ESPRESSO calculations
  from the command line: input generation from CIF/POSCAR, band structure and
  DOS analysis, equation of state, elastic constants, phonons, optics,
  charges, surfaces, defects, transport, Wannier functions and quality
  control, with provenance in every output and the underlying physics
  documented in Spanish and English.
